{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本前組合嵐成員二宮和也，前日(27日)與名導是枝裕和及電影《國寶》監製村田千惠子等出席東京電影節內舉行的座談會。</p><p>談到《國寶》創下的票房奇蹟，二宮表示：「很久沒見過一套電影，每位看過的演都想參與。</p><p>」&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:20:44.664152+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:10:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:18:07.504184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:18:07.504184+00:00","content_hash":"4e32134290546efb1099246908ecc58a8634c64ab15774b3e497a687acc41619","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}